{"id":"f57084ad3c1a7029","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-diagonal-lemma.md","title":"Diagonal Lemma","display":"df-diagonal-lemma — Diagonal Lemma","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-diagonal-lemma","aliases":["90-df-diagonal-lemma"],"display":"df-diagonal-lemma — Diagonal Lemma","depends_on":["[[90-df-substitution-function]]","[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-sentence]]","[[90-df-numeral]]","[[90-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[90-df-strong-representation]]","[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","[[90-df-syntax-interface]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-diagonal-lemma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-diagonal-lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-diagonal-lemma — Diagonal Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7279c20158ac140e\" href=\"?note=7279c20158ac140e\" title=\"90-df-substitution-function\">90-df-substitution-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"cc78339b84b14c7b\" href=\"?note=cc78339b84b14c7b\" title=\"90-df-strong-representation\">90-df-strong-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b7d7a03ff76428de\" href=\"?note=b7d7a03ff76428de\" title=\"90-df-robinson-arithmetic\">90-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>所有公式实例采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a> 的无捕获代入，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a> 的同一规则系统；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,g,d,v\">\\(S,g,d,v\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\)</span> 的固定环境一致。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (fixed arithmetical signature)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-theory) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"b7d7a03ff76428de\" href=\"?note=b7d7a03ff76428de\" title=\"90-df-robinson-arithmetic\">90-df-robinson-arithmetic</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\">\\(d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\)</span> (effective Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_S:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_S:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}_2\\)</span> (coded substitution and binary primitive-recursive class)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongRep}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{StrongRep}_T\\)</span> (strong function-representability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"cc78339b84b14c7b\" href=\"?note=cc78339b84b14c7b\" title=\"90-df-strong-representation\">90-df-strong-representation</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\)</span> (恰有指定自由变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 的公式类, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (句子类, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}\">\\(\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}\\)</span> (a sufficient diagonalization-adequacy predicate, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\n\\land \\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{5em}\\land\n\\exists\\vartheta_{\\mathrm{Sub}}(x,y,z)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(3)}\\;\n\\mathrm{StrongRep}_T(\\mathrm{Sub}_S,\\vartheta_{\\mathrm{Sub}})\n\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\phi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\;\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\nT\\vdash\\bigl(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\n\\phi(\\overline{g(\\psi)})\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\n\\land \\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{5em}\\land\n\\exists\\vartheta_{\\mathrm{Sub}}(x,y,z)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(3)}\\;\n\\mathrm{StrongRep}_T(\\mathrm{Sub}_S,\\vartheta_{\\mathrm{Sub}})\n\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\phi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\;\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\nT\\vdash\\bigl(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\n\\phi(\\overline{g(\\psi)})\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>取强表示见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vartheta(x,y,z)\">\\(\\vartheta(x,y,z)\\)</span>，并按固定新鲜变量算法重命名其束缚变量。对给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi(v)\">\\(\\phi(v)\\)</span>，选择不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\">\\(\\phi\\)</span> 中出现的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\delta(v):=(v=v)\\land\\exists z\\bigl(\\vartheta(v,v,z)\\land\\phi[z/v]\\bigr),\\quad\nb:=g(\\delta),\\quad\\psi:=\\delta[\\bar b/v],\\quad c:=\\mathrm{Sub}_S(b,b)=g(\\psi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\delta(v):=(v=v)\\land\\exists z\\bigl(\\vartheta(v,v,z)\\land\\phi[z/v]\\bigr),\\quad\nb:=g(\\delta),\\quad\\psi:=\\delta[\\bar b/v],\\quad c:=\\mathrm{Sub}_S(b,b)=g(\\psi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>同一符号在不同位置的实例均采用无捕获同时代入。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span> 恰以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 为自由变量，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 是句子，替换编码等式适用。逐数表示给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\vartheta(\\bar b,\\bar b,\\bar c)\">\\(T\\vdash\\vartheta(\\bar b,\\bar b,\\bar c)\\)</span>；内部唯一性给出</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\forall z\\,(\\vartheta(\\bar b,\\bar b,z)\\leftrightarrow z=\\bar c).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T\\vdash\\forall z\\,(\\vartheta(\\bar b,\\bar b,z)\\leftrightarrow z=\\bar c).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 的展开式并用等号替换，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\phi[\\bar c/v]\">\\(T\\vdash\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\phi[\\bar c/v]\\)</span>。自反等式仅确保自由变量类型，不影响等价式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\)</span> 是足够而非必要条件。有效公理化与结论本身无关；真正使用的是有效语法编码及替换函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 中的充分表示能力。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"7279c20158ac140e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"714deb184f73887a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d53b945955293235","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"abc082683aa1de80","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-strong-representation","status":"resolved","id":"cc78339b84b14c7b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-strong-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d7a03ff76428de","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolve