xcerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}$ (恰有指定自由变量 $v$ 的公式类, see [[90-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"714deb184f73887a","anchor":"ref-17","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ (句子类, see [[90-df-sentence]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"S,g,d,v","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_S:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrongRep}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\n&\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\n\\land \\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2\\\\\n&\\hspace{5em}\\land\n\\exists\\vartheta_{\\mathrm{Sub}}(x,y,z)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(3)}\\;\n\\mathrm{StrongRep}_T(\\mathrm{Sub}_S,\\vartheta_{\\mathrm{Sub}})\n\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\n&\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\phi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\;\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\nT\\vdash\\bigl(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\n\\phi(\\overline{g(\\psi)})\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right.","display":true},{"tex":"\\vartheta(x,y,z)","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi(v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta(v):=(v=v)\\land\\exists z\\bigl(\\vartheta(v,v,z)\\land\\phi[z/v]\\bigr),\\quad\nb:=g(\\delta),\\quad\\psi:=\\delta[\\bar b/v],\\quad c:=\\mathrm{Sub}_S(b,b)=g(\\psi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\vartheta(\\bar b,\\bar b,\\bar c)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\forall z\\,(\\vartheta(\\bar b,\\bar b,z)\\leftrightarrow z=\\bar c).","display":true},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\phi[\\bar c/v]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":3214,"backlinks":[{"id":"5defe8d5249da268","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"$S,g,d,v,T$ 与 [[90-df-diagonal-lemma]] 的环境相同；涉及固定点的可证性是 [[90-df-predicate-logic]] 的有限推导，公式在数码处的取值记法展开为 [[90-df-syntax-interface]] 的自由代入。"},{"id":"3a69a5b2bc6a0fd7","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}$ 取 [[90-df-diagonal-lemma]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"fca5455005daa120","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"全部语法与可证性使用 [[90-df-diagonal-lemma]] 的同一环境；涉及 $\\mathrm{Prov}_T$ 时，还使用 [[90-df-proof-predicate]] 中已声明的有效公理化证明呈示，不从 $\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}$ 单独推定公理可枚举。"},{"id":"adc0aa731119457e","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":5,"excerpt":"$S,g,d,v,T$ 与 [[90-df-diagonal-lemma]] 的环境相同；涉及固定点的可证性是 [[90-df-predicate-logic]] 的有限推导，公式在数码处的取值记法展开为 [[90-df-syntax-interface]] 的自由代入。"},{"id":"b2b5974a0bdc4e1b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c4cc1405929acfc1","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e57623a088eec9a8","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7c51b51998a67f02","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"af4f7551b0885593","anchor":"ref-1","locat